WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:06,130
Boss, that’s two hundred thousand for you.

2
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:08,130
There are many things in the world that are more important than money

3
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:09,930
Luck is much more important to me

4
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,930
Today I really want to sell my luck for 200,000 yuan

5
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:13,930
That's really the sesame seeds have been reduced and the watermelon has been lost.

6
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:15,730
If you start a business in the future

7
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:16,930
Be sure to keep this in mind

8
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:18,130
I remember

9
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:21,200
Okay, you go upstairs and bring Yuyu down.

10
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,400
Teach her how to read and write.

11
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:25,400
This girl must have been secretly playing with her watch and eating snacks in the room again.

12
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:33,740
Little boss, read for a while

13
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:35,540
Let's learn a few words, shall we?

14
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:39,320
Let’s learn the Chinese characters with Sister Xiaomeng first

15
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,210
Dad will prepare delicious food for you
